    "location": {
      "start": 171129,
      "end": 171482
    },
    "children": [
      {
        "nodeName": "#text",
        "text": "⬥ The best modifiers to take after Feeling pumped are variable, but generally consistent. Electric, Explosive (if not using ",
        "location": {
          "start": 171132,
          "end": 171256
        }
      },
      {
        "nodeName": "img",
        "tag": "img",
        "attrs": {
          "title": "melee",
          "class": "d-emoji",
          "alt": "melee",
          "src": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/emojis/1096130867279171706.png?v=1"
        },
        "namespace": "http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml",
        "location": {
          "start": 171256,
          "end": 171371
        },
        "children": []
      },
      {
        "nodeName": "#text",
        "text": ") and Charged. However, with an objective like kill X mobs, a negative modifier like Hydra can be positive.",
        "location": {
          "start": 171371,
          "end": 171478
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "nodeName": "#text",
    "text": "\n",
    "location": {
      "start": 171482,
      "end": 171483
    }
  },
  {
    "nodeName": "p",
    "tag": "p",
    "attrs": {},
    "namespace": "http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml",
    "location": {
      "start": 171483,
      "end": 171647
    },
    "children": [
      {
        "nodeName": "#text",
        "text": "‎ ‎ ‎ ‎• In the case of no positive modifiers, options like Zombie Apocalypse, Zone of Suffering or Hungry are the least negative options and can be ignored.",
        "location": {
          "start": 171486,
          "end": 171643
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  {
